    "title": "14 Historic U.S. Supreme Court Justices Born in New York - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Kachejian ,\n21 hours ago New York has produced fourteen justices of the Supreme Court of the United States, from the nation’s first Chief Justice, John Jay, to three members of the current Court. Their birthplaces stretch from New York City and the Hudson Valley to the North Country, Central New York, and Western New York. Read full article",
